nAnd somehow the media act like it's not a big deal. Like Phoney Carmey somehow won by \"retaliating\" and adding tariffs on US products... yeah, really gonna help me at Costco, will it? \n\nYou know how many fruits, textiles, technology and shit Canada produces? Not very many. Strawberries in summer, peaches sometimes, and Blackberries. Yeah.\n\nSo anyway, if you look at popular website (use AI to translate - lapresse.ca and journaldemontreal.com), it's 90% \"news\" about muh counter-tariffs, and by news, I mean propaganda. Fake experts going on saying \"The biggest loser is Trump\" (LOL) and \"Carmey is a saviour\" blah blah blah.\n\nFact is, many factories cannot withstand a 25% tariff, let alone a 50% one. Our car industry for instance, which is junk, will simply disappear. Americans won't buy an auto part in Canada witha 50% tariffs if they can buy it for 0% tariffs in the US.\n\nEver heard of C-series? Imagine that, but on a grand scale.\n\nSo anyway, I have to thank you. It's glorious watching the media meltdown.\n\nOne final thing: Canada could not afford half of its social programs if the US didn't finance them indirectly. Our free healthcare is LITERALLY because we have a cheap dollar and export so much to the US.\n\nIf tariffs hold, and I hope they do (or even go up, but there's no real point, they are high enough already), Canada's lumber, mining, textile, production and agricultural economy (grains mostly) is 100% fucked, period. \n\nCanada's economy is already trash (worst in developed nations). This is really gonna fuck up the boomers who destroyed this country (see: gun grabbing, no more freedom of speech online, backdoor in every device, and other tyrannical laws that passed just in the last year) and I'm glad those fuckers will suffer.", "author": "Quebec_Is_A_ShitHole", "created": 1787419051053, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "bobbacringo", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": f