anyway, I have to thank you. It's glorious watching the media meltdown.</p>\n<p>One final thing: Canada could not afford half of its social programs if the US didn't finance them indirectly. Our free healthcare is LITERALLY because we have a cheap dollar and export so much to the US.</p>\n<p>If tariffs hold, and I hope they do (or even go up, but there's no real point, they are high enough already), Canada's lumber, mining, textile, production and agricultural economy (grains mostly) is 100% fucked, period.</p>\n<p>Canada's economy is already trash (worst in developed nations). This is really gonna fuck up the boomers who destroyed this country (see: gun grabbing, no more freedom of speech online, backdoor in every device, and other tyrannical laws that passed just in the last year) and I'm glad those fuckers will suffer.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 22, "score_up": 96, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNRaatX", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 237, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8793043, "raw_content": "", "author": "Seeker_17", "created": 1787400538046, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "stars", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "thenationalpulse.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNRaatX.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://thenationalpulse.com/2026/08/22/over-80-of-north-african-migrants-have-been-accused-of-at-least-one-crime-in-this-european-country/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash"